"description":"Homage is your one-stop solution for a holistic range of home and community-based healthcare services.\n\n\nWe currently operate in Singapore, Malaysia and Australia, and have delivered over one million caregiving hours since we started in 2016. Our mission is to care where you are, and enable wellness and recovery through holistic personal care.\n\n\nOur diverse team of highly qualified care professionals includes caregivers, nurses and therapists who are committed to supporting your healthcare needs, 24/7, wherever you are.\n\n\nHere are some ways we can support you and your loved ones needs:\n- Personal Care including assistance with activities of daily living for the elderly and those requiring disability support\n- Nursing Care including procedures such as wound care, stoma care, NGT feeding and change\n- Therapy including physiotherapy, speech therapy and occupational therapy (for Singapore and Malaysia)\n\n\nHere are some reasons families prefer Homage:\n- Personalised Care Plans: We can help create a care plan catered to your needs and choices\n- Dedicated Care Professionals: Receive quality care from a pool of curated and experienced Care Professionals\n- Detailed Care Reports: Receive a visit summary after every visit so you are updated with the care your loved ones have received\n- Zero Commitment: Book flexible care solutions from 1 hour with no ongoing commitment required\n- Transparent Pricing: Know the exact cost of service before booking a visit\n- Prepaid Packages: Achieve cost savings with our long term packages that offer the same quality care at a lower cost\n\n\nOur services are currently available in:\n- Singapore\n- Malaysia: Kuala Lumpur, Johor Bahru, Penang and Perak\n- Australia: Melbourne, Perth, Adelaide\n\n\nFind out more about Homage at www.homage.co", "bundleId":"com.homage.careowner", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.86486000000000018417267710901796817779541015625, "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"100